### Record usage (201); exact replay returns 200
POST http://localhost:8080/v1/usage-events
X-API-Key: bk_demo.demo-secret
X-Tenant-Id: demo-tenant
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "eventId": "evt-20261101-0001",
  "subscriptionId": "40000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001",
  "meterKey": "api_calls",
  "quantity": 125,
  "occurredAt": "2026-11-01T10:00:00Z",
  "attributes": {"region": "ap-south-1", "plan": "growth"}
}

### Preview graduated usage charges for the seeded subscription
GET http://localhost:8080/v1/rating-previews?subscriptionId=40000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001&from=2026-11-01T00:00:00Z&to=2026-12-01T00:00:00Z
X-API-Key: bk_demo.demo-secret
X-Tenant-Id: demo-tenant

### Finalize an invoice; exact period replay returns 200 and the original invoice
POST http://localhost:8080/v1/invoices/finalize?subscriptionId=40000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001&from=2026-11-01T00:00:00Z&to=2026-12-01T00:00:00Z
X-API-Key: bk_demo.demo-secret
X-Tenant-Id: demo-tenant

### Issue a partial credit against a finalized invoice
POST http://localhost:8080/v1/invoices/{{invoiceId}}/credits
X-API-Key: bk_demo.demo-secret
X-Tenant-Id: demo-tenant
Idempotency-Key: credit-service-outage-20261106
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "amount": 5.00,
  "reason": "Service-level adjustment"
}

### Inspect relay health and metrics
GET http://localhost:8080/actuator/health

### Prometheus endpoint
GET http://localhost:8080/actuator/prometheus

### Read event-time metered usage (upper bound is exclusive)
GET http://localhost:8080/v1/usage-summary?subscriptionId=40000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001&meterKey=api_calls&from=2026-11-01T00:00:00Z&to=2026-12-01T00:00:00Z
X-API-Key: bk_demo.demo-secret
X-Tenant-Id: demo-tenant

### Read low-latency current-period usage from the Redis projection
GET http://localhost:8080/v1/realtime-usage?subscriptionId=40000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001&meterKey=api_calls&period=2026-11
X-API-Key: bk_demo.demo-secret
X-Tenant-Id: demo-tenant

### Review usage detected after an invoice was finalized
GET http://localhost:8080/v1/billing-adjustments?subscriptionId=40000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001&status=PENDING
X-API-Key: bk_demo.demo-secret
X-Tenant-Id: demo-tenant

### Explicitly waive a pending late-usage adjustment
POST http://localhost:8080/v1/billing-adjustments/{{adjustmentId}}/waive
X-API-Key: bk_demo.demo-secret
X-Tenant-Id: demo-tenant
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "reason": "Usage arrived after the contractual adjustment window"
}
